tigkeit [] geübt wird.\n— 2〉 m. N. pr.\n — a〉 eine Mannes.\n — b〉 eines Mahābrahman.\n — c〉 eines Fürsten der Kiṃnara.\n — d〉 eines Palastes CAURAP. (A.) 16.\n— 3〉 f. आ\n — a〉 die Versammlungshalle der Götter VĀSAV. 244,1. DIVYĀVAD. 220,7. JĀTAKAM. 6.\n — b〉 N. pr. der Gattin Mātaliʼs.\n— 4〉 *f. ई = 3〉a〉.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["सुधर्म्म", "सुधर्म्मः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["suDarmma", "suDarmmaH"]}], "suDarman": [{"id": "suDarman", "headword": "सुधर्मन्", "headword_slp1": "suDarman", "fold": "suDarman", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "सुध꣫र्मन्\n— 1〉 Adj.\n — a〉 wohl stützend, — wahrend in einer Formel.\n — b〉 Gerechtigkeit übend.\n— 2〉 m.\n — a〉 die Versammlungshalle der Götter DAŚAK. 7,19.\n — b〉 *= कुटुम्बिन्.\n — c〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 eines zu den Viśve Devās gezählten Wesens.\n — β〉 Pl. verschiedener Göttersippen unter verschiedenen Manu.\n — γ〉 verschiedener Fürsten.\n — δ〉 eines Gaṇādhipa (Kevalin) der Jaina VARDHAMĀNAC. 1,41. HEM. PAR. 2,41. 51. Auch सुधर्मस्वामिन् 43. fgg. 4,56.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["सुधर्म्मन्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["suDarmman"]}], "suDarmita": [{"id": "suDarmitA", "headword": "सुधर्मिता", "headword_slp1": "suDarmitA", "fold": "suDarmita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "सुधर्मिता f. umschreibende Bezeichnung eines Dinges durch Angabe seiner Merkmale Comm. zu VĀSAV. 4.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "suDarmin": [{"id": "suDarmin", "headword": "सुधर्मिन्", "headword_slp1": "suDarmin", "fold": "suDarmin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "सुधर्मिन् m. fehlerhaft für सुधमन् 2〉a〉.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "suDarmisWa": [{"id": "suDarmizWa", "headword": "सुधर्मिष्ठ", "headword_slp1": "suDarmizWa", "fold": "suDarmisWa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "सुधर्मिष्ठ Adj. (f. आ) seinen Pflichten genau nachkommend.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "suDa": [{"id": "suDA", "headword": "सुधा", "headword_slp1": "suDA", "fold": "suDa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "1. सुधा꣫ f. Wohlbefinden, Behagen. Nach SĀY. der Himmel.", "gloss_language": "de"}, {"gloss": "2. सुधा f.\n— 1〉 der Trank der Götter, Nektar.\n— 2〉 Milch. Auch. Pl.\n— 3〉 Kalk, stucco.\n— 4〉 *Backstein.\n— 5〉 *Wasser, Saft.\n— 6〉 *Honig.\n— 7〉 *Blitz.\n— 8〉 *die Erde GAL.\n— 9〉 Euphorbia antiquorum oder eine andere Species CARAKA. 7,10.\n— 10〉 *Sansevieria roxburghiana.\n— 11〉 *Glycine debilis.\n— 12〉 *Myrobalane.\n— 13〉 *ein best. Metrum.\n— 14〉 N. pr. der Gattin eines Rudra. Vgl. ZACH. Beitr.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "suDansu": [{"id": "suDAMSu", "headword": "सुधांशु", "headword_slp1": "suDAMSu", "fold": "suDansu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "सुधांशु m.\n— 1〉 der Mond.\n— 2〉 *Kampfer. ˚तैल n. Kampferöl.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["सुधांशुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["suDAMSuH"]}], "suDansuBa": [{"id": "suDAMSuBa", "headword": "सुधांशुभ", "headword_slp1": "suDAMSuBa", "fold": "suDansuBa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*सुधांशुभ n. und *सुधांशुरत्न n. Perle RĀJAN. 13,153 nebst Note.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "suDakaRWa": [{"id": "suDAkaRWa", "headword": "सुधाकण्ठ", "headword_slp1": "suDAkaRWa", "fold": "suDakaRWa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*सुधाकण्ठ m. der indische Kuckuck.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["सुधाकण्ठः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["suDAkaRWaH"]}], "suDakara": [{"id": "suDAkara", "headword": "सुधाकर", "headword_slp1": "suDAkara", "fold": "suDakara", "headw